Import the C function iswalpha taking an unsigned integer, returning an integer, from the header "wctype.h".
Import the C function iswdigit taking an unsigned integer, returning an integer, from the header "wctype.h".
If Call iswalpha with 65 done is not equal to 0 then: Say "alpha". End if.
If Call iswdigit with 65 done is equal to 0 then: Say "not digit". End if.
